{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"90ac764107993e72f2f520cb624891cddfc2c8689d5d9ace4739e34477fb3b8b","ja":"突然の演出","zh":"突然的演出","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6e119b581f2466c27a413d759205909317284484a943fdec6d56954618c1fc94","ja":"プロレスの試合前にライブだけをする予定だった\nはずが、雲行きが怪しくなって……","zh":"原本只打算在职业摔角比赛前进行演出的\n没想到情况变得有些不对劲……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cac044b8ef2e07236dade6dfaa175b24029de1ae7b12b303a93476c6a7e484f7","ja":"えっと……みなさんに気合い注入って、\nどういうことをするんでしょう……？","zh":"那个……给大家注入干劲，\n是要做什么呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b46b2fd12c3ec649444991a23c988a8196ee0e5fdf7e2acc23eb799f401ce220","ja":"「叱咤激励をお願いします！\nもちろん、プロレスの技を仕掛けていただいても！」","zh":"「请给我鼓励！\n当然，就算对我使出职业摔跤的招式也没关系！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6f799809f4e1311695666e3a805fbb9baf52177efdacc274429d004a51df5a62","ja":"い、いきなりそんなことを言われても、\nいったいどうすれば……。","zh":"突、突然被这么说，\n到底该怎么办……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bc5520110a980c7cb19729bf4c683d9a43e3c76604ac2981931c0d0aa482d1c9","ja":"いいんですか！？　やった～！　現役レスラーに\n技をいれさせてもらえるなんて、光栄です！","zh":"真的可以吗！？　太好了～！　能对现役摔跤手\n施展招式，真是荣幸！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7035619374e81f5b4d5b32dc3a17b44a3e8d445e0dd37721b1b6bf03f1d392e1","ja":"それじゃあアタシから！　頑張って、の思いを込めた\n全力チョップ、受け取ってください！　せ～～のっ！","zh":"那就由我先来！请接下这饱含“加油”心意的全力手刀！一、二——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"69bb151d973d67dff33412943e1bc3ef2f426dd75fe40413922c69180f96dd57","ja":"バチーーーン！\n「はっはっは！　腰が入った、いいチョップだ！」","zh":"啪——！\n「哈哈哈！　腰劲十足，好一个手刀！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"70efa0dd3bb6154215542a81177cf2bdd0a6ca82f95ed91d6bf628a239692fe0","ja":"（のり子さん、すごい。迷いがなくって……。\nだったら、私も演技だと思って……）","zh":"（典子，好厉害。毫不犹豫……。\n那么，我也当作是演技……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b17607191119c6f92cb78b6507f6854b5984c45e3e549748e90cf9f63e87e6e6","ja":"次は私です。痛くても知りませんから、\n覚悟してくださいね。","zh":"接下来是我。就算痛我也不管，\n请做好觉悟吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d8f7bcabac697ed3fdd87afd42586e81bd70e57ce183b7e5b1250fb1d90b56f0","ja":"バシッ！\n「おっ、今の蹴り……意外と効いたぜ～！？」","zh":"啪！\n“哦，刚才那一脚……没想到还挺有效～！？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"913c3416eab0c8d94d43d0dd220ce4439915d32edbf4c51e28b1e43696114406","ja":"じゃあ私も！　せっかくだし……ストンピング！\nからの～……ラリアットよ！","zh":"那我也来！难得有机会……踩踏！\n接着……飞冲肩！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"81f2fabe5c0d87e021d5848ba460bf9cb79a5159f429813c02cf07429546851c","ja":"「うおおおおおっ」\n「連続で！？　姐さん、すげぇぜ！」","zh":"「呜哦哦哦哦哦！」\n「连续！？　大姐，太厉害了！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4ff03dac5b0261ce659f3542e08a740930349cd33aa07b6503cf1afff7d9a5ac","ja":"（ふふっ、いいリアクションね！\nさすが熟練レスラー！）","zh":"（呵呵，反应不错呢！\n不愧是资深摔角手！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0d9e7b59cfb264266fdeb1398864c47c6c0f4a45669436e85ca8dd1f0060f5a3","ja":"「うっす！　自分にも気合い入れてくださいっ！」","zh":"好嘞！也请给自己鼓鼓劲！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"68b865218d6aeeb4a39ec695c7f37d79eb0425dd7b47cb4456c49bb91f3462c8","ja":"もちろん！　アタシのすべての力を込めていくよ～！？\nイチ、ニ、サン……とりゃああああ！","zh":"当然！我会倾注我全部的力量哦～！？\n一、二、三……喝啊啊啊啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"ae8b5f663f382395c7d89bc72860698831660ad7bdc1857951125477a85ee241","ja":"「入った～～～！\n福田さんの強烈なエルボ～～～！」","zh":"「打中了～～～！福田小姐的猛烈肘击～～～！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1769.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"2369f016c45e3e4cee387312238b11b8c010af949c70e1fa1f1a1f28ac0347a3","ja":"ほら、春香たちも！　ここはプロレスのリングだよ！\n思いっきり暴れちゃお～っ！","zh":"快看，春香她们也！这里是职业摔跤的擂台哦！\n尽情大闹一场吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
